WEBVTT

00:00:03.995 --> 00:00:09.628
Typecase checks your spelling as you type. Everything happens on your computer, without the internet.

00:00:09.928 --> 00:00:12.895
Misspelled words get a wavy red underline.

00:00:20.197 --> 00:00:23.675
Right-click the word for suggestions, and pick the right one.

00:00:24.283 --> 00:00:29.788
Names and words of your own? Add them to the dictionary, and Typecase knows them from then on.

00:00:30.088 --> 00:00:37.236
Each sheet is checked in its own language. Set it in the properties, or choose a default for all sheets in the preferences.

00:00:40.909 --> 00:00:49.252
Press F7 or the button in the bar to switch spell checking off and on. In focus mode, it stays off unless you switch it on there.

00:00:49.553 --> 00:00:55.207
If a dictionary is missing, Typecase tells you. Our website shows how to add more languages.

00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:58.431
Fewer typos, and nothing leaves your computer.

00:00:59.331 --> 00:01:02.063
Typecase. Free software, made for GNOME.

00:01:02.363 --> 00:01:04.946
With love, by kleinod.studio.
